## Cross-subject

Every lean is to a kindergarten core course, the same year, so each is on the availability calendar. Course days and
weeks for the other courses are as their frames state them and data/plans/calendar.csv places them; exact lesson-level
availability waits on their scopes and sequences, so each lean keeps its "if later" line.

