ss1-supporting-questions, a grade 1 course taught the year before. Course days and weeks for the other courses are as
their frames state them and data/plans/calendar.csv places them; exact lesson-level availability waits on their
scopes and sequences, so each same-year lean keeps its "if later" line. Library is not a core course, so no core
course assumes it (lesson 32).

