# version: AASL Standards Framework for Learners, National School Library Standards, 2nd edition (published September 2025; the learner framework PDF's file name is dated 2025-09-18 and its footer says copyright 2026). The ids were first counted from the 2018 1st edition and are the same in both.
# note: label corrected 2026-11-11. The file name (aasl-2018.txt) and the frameworks tag AASL-2018 in data/modules.csv and scripts/standards.py still carry the old year, because tool specs cite the file by name and the checker matches the tag. They are names only: the ids here are current against the 2nd edition.
